<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>Why Choose Us</span>
      </div>
      <div class="page-hero-content">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#38bdf8;">The REINWERK Advantage</span>
        <h1>Engineered for Compliance, Speed, and Longevity</h1>
        <p>
          Cleanrooms are mission-critical production assets. Discover why leading pharmaceutical manufacturers, microelectronics fabs, and medtech leaders choose REINWERK for turnkey contamination control.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Differentiators Grid -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our Competitive Edge</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Built Upon Four Pillars of Excellence</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          We combine German engineering precision, off-site modular prefabrication, and rigorous validation into a frictionless client experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2" style="gap:40px;">
        <div class="card" style="padding:36px; border-left:4px solid var(--primary-navy);">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px;">
            <div style="width:48px; height:48px; background:var(--clean-blue-light); color:var(--primary-navy); border-radius:var(--radius-md); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
              <i data-feather="check-square" style="width:24px; height:24px;"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.375rem;">Single-Source Turnkey Accountability</h3>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:0.9375rem; color:var(--slate-600); line-height:1.7;">
            Traditional cleanroom builds involve disjointed architects, HVAC contractors, partition installers, and third-party certifiers—frequently causing costly finger-pointing when pressure cascades or particle limits fail. REINWERK takes 100% turnkey responsibility from conceptual BIM modeling through final certified handover.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="padding:36px; border-left:4px solid var(--accent-red);">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px;">
            <div style="width:48px; height:48px; background:#fee2e2; color:var(--accent-red); border-radius:var(--radius-md); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
              <i data-feather="clock" style="width:24px; height:24px;"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.375rem;">Up to 50% Shorter On-site Delivery</h3>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:0.9375rem; color:var(--slate-600); line-height:1.7;">
            By manufacturing precision wall cassettes, walk-on ceilings, and dynamic pass-through airlocks off-site in clean factory conditions, we perform parallel construction while base building readiness is prepared. On-site installation is completely dust-free, non-invasive, and completed in weeks rather than months.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="padding:36px; border-left:4px solid #0284c7;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px;">
            <div style="width:48px; height:48px; background:var(--clean-blue-light); color:#0284c7; border-radius:var(--radius-md); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
              <i data-feather="file-text" style="width:24px; height:24px;"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.375rem;">Audit-Proof GAMP 5 Validation</h3>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:0.9375rem; color:var(--slate-600); line-height:1.7;">
            Every cleanroom is supplied with comprehensive Design Qualification (DQ), Installation Qualification (IQ), Operational Qualification (OQ), and Performance Qualification (PQ) dossiers. Fully compliant with EU-GMP Annex 1 and FDA 21 CFR Part 211, our documentation is proven in international regulatory audits.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="padding:36px; border-left:4px solid #10b981;">
          <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px;">
            <div style="width:48px; height:48px; background:#ecfdf5; color:#10b981; border-radius:var(--radius-md); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
              <i data-feather="activity" style="width:24px; height:24px;"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-size:1.375rem;">Energy-Optimized HVAC Engineering</h3>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:0.9375rem; color:var(--slate-600); line-height:1.7;">
            Cleanrooms can consume up to 25 times more energy than standard commercial facilities. We integrate direct-drive EC centrifugal fans (IE5 efficiency), intelligent enthalpy heat recovery systems, and automated night-setback airflow balancing—cutting operational power overheads by up to 35%.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Technical Comparison Table -->
  <section class="section section-bg-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Direct Comparison</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">REINWERK Modular vs. Traditional Drywall</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">
          See why modular cleanroom construction is rapidly replacing conventional construction for regulated environments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="padding:0; overflow:hidden;">
        <table class="spec-table" style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
          <thead style="background:var(--primary-navy); color:var(--white);">
            <tr>
              <th style="padding:16px 24px; text-align:left; font-size:0.9375rem;">Criteria</th>
              <th style="padding:16px 24px; text-align:left; font-size:0.9375rem; background:var(--primary-navy-dark); color:#38bdf8;">REINWERK Modular Cleanroom</th>
              <th style="padding:16px 24px; text-align:left; font-size:0.9375rem; color:var(--slate-300);">Traditional Drywall Cleanroom</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:700;">On-site Build Timeline</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:600; color:var(--primary-navy);">4 - 8 Weeks (Parallel Off-site Fabrication)</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; color:var(--slate-600);">16 - 28 Weeks (Serial On-site Trades)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:700;">Installation Cleanliness</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:600; color:var(--primary-navy);">Dust-free mechanical assembly with zero wet trades</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; color:var(--slate-600);">Heavy drywall sanding dust, paint fumes, prolonged curing</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:700;">Future Modifiability</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:600; color:var(--primary-navy);">100% demountable & reconfigurable with zero waste</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; color:var(--slate-600);">Destructive demolition required for any alteration</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:700;">Chemical / VHP Resistance</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:600; color:var(--primary-navy);">Impermeable HPL, PVDF, or 316L stainless surfaces</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; color:var(--slate-600);">Porous paint layers prone to bubbling and degradation</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:700;">Air Tightness</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:600; color:var(--primary-navy);">Class 4 EN 12207 airtight silicone-free dry gaskets</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; color:var(--slate-600);">Prone to hairline micro-cracks over settling cycles</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:700;">Depreciation & Tax Benefit</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; font-weight:600; color:var(--primary-navy);">Often classified as tangible equipment (accelerated 7-yr)</td>
              <td style="padding:16px 24px; color:var(--slate-600);">Classified as real estate building asset (39-yr lifespan)</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Reusable CTA Consultation Banner -->
  <%- include('../partials/cta-banner') %>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
